        "TileImage": "$($repository dff26cc7-ac07-4a50-a30d-b8917b7c4649).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening Agent 47. Your target is Alexander Dugan also known as &quot;The Jackal&quot;. A reclusive assassin who has caused a lot of trouble in Britain and Tallinn. He is an expert in disguise and has many identities. And today he has chosen to be Aidan Kelly or so his passport says. He is in Wilton Creek to assassinate a leading politician for the US presidency. Our employers MI6 want to prevent this due to his pro-EU views. Time is running out. I will leave you to prepare.",
